  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with count output and three labeled buttons."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --btn: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0a0a1a;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-size: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-size: 64px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  min-height: 80px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, background 0.2s;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  #count { font-size: 48px; }\n  button { font-size: 18px; padding: 10px 16px; }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-themed styling with cohesive palette, responsive layout, and visible hover/focus/pressed states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  let count = 0;\n  const output = document.getElementById('count');\n\n  function render() {\n    output.textContent = String(count);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();",
      "description": "Counter logic with addEventListener, supporting negative numbers and reset."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA self-contained offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. The counter starts at 0.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **Increase (+)** — adds 1 to the count.\n- **Decrease (−)** — subtracts 1 from the count (supports negative numbers).\n- **Reset** — sets the count back to 0.\n\nAll buttons are keyboard-accessible: use Tab to focus and Enter or Space to activate.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and controls\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed responsive styling\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n\n## Notes\n\n- Works from 360px wide and up.\n- State is not persisted; refreshing resets to 0.",
      "description": "README with usage, controls, and file overview."
    }
  ]
